@startuml

title Events and round transition

participant Client1
participant Server
participant Client2

Client1->Server: final ChooseCardRequest of the round
Server->Server: apply card
Server->Server: resolve visible events automatically
Server->Server: apply event and building effects

alt another round remains
Server->Server: end round and create next round
Server->Server: enter ROUND_OFFER
else final round completed
Server->Server: resolve final events
Server->Server: calculate winners and enter END_GAME
end

Server-->Client1: GameViewUpdate(updated board snapshot)
Server-->Client2: GameViewUpdate(updated board snapshot)

loop each structured event entry produced
Server-->Client1: EventNotification
Server-->Client2: EventNotification
end

Server-->Client1: GameOperationResult.Snapshot(Card chosen, same snapshot)

note over Client1, Client2
The board snapshot is sent before EventNotification,
so the UI already contains the resolved event effects.
end note

@enduml
